// Conformance fixture for ta.cum (S-bead OpenBBTechnical-0e9.5.43, Wave 5B-4).
//
// Author-derivative posture per PRD §7.3: reference output computed by
// hand-computing the running total against a hard-coded synthetic close
// series (see ta_cum.csv `close` column).
//
// ta.cum has no ``length`` argument — it accumulates from the first
// bar. No warmup phase; the first bar equals the first source value.
//@version=6
indicator("smoke_ta_cum", overlay=false)
plot(ta.cum(close), title="cum")
